    <headline>Budhi Gandaki: river blocked by the Lokpa–Chumling landslide burst; riverside areas stay alert</headline>
    <description>NDRRMA press note (2083-06-25): a big landslide between Lokpa and Chumling in Chumnubri Rural Municipality-6 blocked the Budhi Gandaki. The blockage burst into a large debris flood and caused physical damage. River banks in Gorkha, Dhading, Tanahun, Chitwan, and Nawalparasi East and West; very high risk down to Benighat, high alert up to Mugling.</description>
    <instruction>Stay away from the river and risky settlements. Do not assume the risk is over even if the flow looks lower. Do not go to watch the flood. Follow police and local announcements.</instruction>
